
Yes! You mean MongoDB in the MERN Stack. 😊
MERN is a full-stack web development technology stack consisting of four technologies:
M E R N
M
MongoDB
Database
E
Express.js
Backend framework
R
React.js
Frontend library
N
Node.js
JavaScript runtime
What does each technology do?
MongoDB: Stores application data, such as usernames, passwords, products and user details.
Express.js: Handles backend routes and API requests.
React.js: Creates the user interface that users interact with.
Node.js: Runs JavaScript on the server side.
